WEBVTT

00:01.410 --> 00:03.860
Chookity? Chookity!Shoot the laser.
Shoot the laser!

00:03.890 --> 00:05.130
What Mooncake
is trying to say here is...

00:05.170 --> 00:06.370
Previously on "Final Space"...

00:06.410 --> 00:07.370
Avocato's been trying to save

00:07.410 --> 00:08.410
his son, Little Cato,

00:08.440 --> 00:10.480
for a long freakin' time,

00:10.510 --> 00:12.030
who the Lord Commander
has locked away.

00:12.060 --> 00:13.370
Oh, crap!

00:13.410 --> 00:14.750
Gary swore
that he wouldn't rest

00:14.790 --> 00:16.130
until Little Cato
was back home safe,

00:16.170 --> 00:18.650
and Gary always keeps his word.

00:18.680 --> 00:21.790
♪♪

00:23.170 --> 00:26.370
♪♪

00:32.440 --> 00:35.030
H.U.E.: Four minutes
of oxygen left, Gary.

00:35.060 --> 00:36.720
[ Gary sighs ]

00:36.750 --> 00:40.170
Avocato, now would be the time
to appear and scoop me up.

00:40.200 --> 00:42.130
He's not coming, Gary.

00:42.170 --> 00:44.750
I'm afraid no one is.

00:44.790 --> 00:47.890
H.U.E., what are my chances
that I'm secretly an immortal?

00:47.930 --> 00:51.000
Like Zeus, Hercules,
or Octoprime Rex?

00:51.030 --> 00:53.000
There is no chance.

00:53.030 --> 00:54.130
I think there's a chance I got

00:54.170 --> 00:55.650
an Octoprime Rex thing
going on.

00:55.680 --> 00:56.510
Big time.

00:56.550 --> 00:59.000
You have absolutely no chance

00:59.030 --> 01:00.750
because Octoprime Rex

01:00.790 --> 01:02.650
is completely fabricated
by you.

01:02.680 --> 01:04.340
If we're talking percentages

01:04.370 --> 01:07.130
of me becoming
an eight-sided enhanced T-Rex,

01:07.170 --> 01:08.200
what are the odds?

01:08.240 --> 01:10.200
Zero percent.

01:10.240 --> 01:12.370
So death it is.

01:12.410 --> 01:15.310
[ Alarm beeping ]

01:15.340 --> 01:18.550
♪♪

01:23.240 --> 01:26.510
♪♪

01:31.200 --> 01:34.440
♪♪

01:50.930 --> 01:53.650
[ Device beeping ]

01:53.680 --> 01:54.720
H.U.E.,
can you patch this in?

01:54.750 --> 01:56.340
H.U.E.:
Transferring.

01:56.370 --> 01:58.170
[ All gasp ] Dad, these are my coordinates.

01:58.200 --> 01:59.170
Come find me.

01:59.200 --> 02:00.480
I mean, at your leisure,

02:00.510 --> 02:02.340
but like,
for me preferably fast.

02:02.370 --> 02:03.340
That'd be great.

02:03.370 --> 02:04.370
Is that your son?

02:04.410 --> 02:06.060
Yes.He looks healthy.

02:06.100 --> 02:07.750
I mean, look, yeah,
it looks like -- it looks like

02:07.790 --> 02:09.240
you did a pretty good job
raising the boy.

02:09.270 --> 02:10.580
I mean, it's obvious
he's been bathing.

02:10.620 --> 02:12.000
H.U.E.: I've traced
the coordinates

02:12.030 --> 02:14.750
to the Udrex System
in Sector 11.

02:14.790 --> 02:17.030
H.U.E., set a course.
Sector 11.

02:17.060 --> 02:19.170
Out of the question!
We've got a breach to close!

02:19.200 --> 02:21.480
H.U.E., Sector 11.
Now!

02:21.510 --> 02:23.130
[ Growls ]Stand back.

02:23.170 --> 02:24.130
-Ah!
-I get it.

02:24.170 --> 02:25.550
He's your son.

02:25.580 --> 02:28.000
But a world can end
if we don't close the breach.

02:28.030 --> 02:30.170
You're right.
It is my son.

02:30.200 --> 02:31.550
And we're getting him.[ Gasps ]

02:31.580 --> 02:33.030
Dude!
What the freak?!

02:33.060 --> 02:34.130
Gary, which is it?

02:34.170 --> 02:35.200
[ Gasps ]Earth, or his son?

02:35.240 --> 02:37.030
You're going
to have to choose.

02:37.060 --> 02:38.480
Remember.
You promised.

02:38.510 --> 02:41.200
[ Laughs ]
It's going down!

02:41.240 --> 02:43.030
It...is...going...

02:43.060 --> 02:44.650
downtown, y'all![ Guns fire ]

02:44.680 --> 02:46.310
[ Screams ]

02:46.340 --> 02:48.170
I've thought on it...

02:48.200 --> 02:49.820
And I choose both.

02:49.860 --> 02:52.340
But first, we need
to save Little Cato.

02:53.790 --> 02:55.000
In the chair!

02:55.030 --> 02:56.480
[ Groans ]

02:56.510 --> 02:59.480
You're saying your son is worth
the lives of --

02:59.510 --> 03:00.410
Yes.

03:00.440 --> 03:02.370
Is this totally necessary?

03:02.410 --> 03:04.340
Avocato:
KVN, watch her.

03:04.370 --> 03:07.030
I can't believe
I trusted you.

03:07.060 --> 03:09.680
We're gonna do
both jobs.

03:10.410 --> 03:12.340
Hang tight.
We'll be back.

03:19.580 --> 03:21.310
You sure you want
to do this?

03:21.340 --> 03:23.680
There's a 99% chance
that this is a trap.

03:23.720 --> 03:27.130
Traps are just
open casting calls for heroes.

03:27.170 --> 03:28.820
Plus,
you already tied up Quinn,

03:28.860 --> 03:32.130
so there's no real
rebound after that.

03:32.170 --> 03:33.240
You're a good friend.

03:33.270 --> 03:34.720
I would've gone
with "great."

03:34.750 --> 03:36.480
But whatever.
I'll take...good.

03:36.510 --> 03:38.340
What is happening?

03:38.370 --> 03:39.890
I think
we're about to hug.

03:39.930 --> 03:41.030
Should we?

03:41.060 --> 03:44.000
The siren's call
is beckoning us to embrace.

03:44.030 --> 03:46.550
We shan't ignore her.

03:46.580 --> 03:48.650
Mmm.

03:48.680 --> 03:49.930
Hell, yeah.

03:49.960 --> 03:51.820
Thanks, bud.
Needed that.

03:51.860 --> 03:53.060
Let's get your boy back.

03:53.100 --> 03:55.310
[ Laughs ]
Chookity!

03:55.340 --> 03:56.510
Mooncake, we're gonna need

03:56.550 --> 03:58.650
rich sacks of back up.Ooh!

03:58.680 --> 04:01.000
We're goin' down
to the Lord Commander's
prison colony.

04:01.030 --> 04:02.550
It's dangerous!Ooh!

04:02.580 --> 04:04.060
It's life-threatening!
We're probably gonna die.

04:04.100 --> 04:06.130
[ Whimpers ]I -- you got my back,
little buddy?

04:06.170 --> 04:07.820
Chookity!

04:07.860 --> 04:10.200
I didn't really sell that
very well, did I?

04:10.240 --> 04:12.240
Crap!
So no back up.

04:12.270 --> 04:14.510
Just two hombres
with a dream.

04:14.550 --> 04:16.650
H.U.E., let's do this.

04:16.680 --> 04:24.370
♪♪

04:24.410 --> 04:25.510
We have arrived.

04:25.550 --> 04:26.650
Then land this thing.

04:26.680 --> 04:29.000
Unfortunately, if we land,

04:29.030 --> 04:30.340
we will be detected.

04:30.370 --> 04:31.720
You'll have to space vault.

04:31.750 --> 04:33.510
Are you sa-- are you saying
we gotta jump?

04:33.550 --> 04:35.200
Jump like freakin'
a zillion feet

04:35.240 --> 04:36.510
through
that purple cloud?!

04:36.550 --> 04:37.820
How close
can you get us?

04:37.860 --> 04:40.680
Hmm.
Nowhere near close enough.

04:40.720 --> 04:42.890
I can do
nowhere near close enough.

04:42.930 --> 04:45.650
Punch it, H.U.E.!

04:45.680 --> 04:49.030
♪♪

04:49.060 --> 04:52.240
♪ Oh

04:52.270 --> 04:55.510
♪♪

04:57.510 --> 05:00.130
♪ Ooh, ooh-ooh

05:00.170 --> 05:03.410
♪♪

05:04.720 --> 05:05.890
[ Music continues in helmet ]What is this?

05:05.930 --> 05:06.750
Two planets?!

05:06.790 --> 05:08.480
There's two!
Which one is it?

05:08.510 --> 05:10.650
It's left.
Right?

05:10.680 --> 05:11.750
Right?

05:11.790 --> 05:13.750
I-I can't hear you
over the music!

05:13.790 --> 05:14.890
Right it is!

05:14.930 --> 05:16.130
Gary!

05:16.170 --> 05:17.890
♪♪

05:17.930 --> 05:20.240
♪ Oh, oh

05:21.060 --> 05:26.680
♪ Hey

05:26.720 --> 05:29.410
[ Music stops ]Something feels wrong.

05:29.440 --> 05:31.550
Yeah, because
we're on the wrong planet.

05:31.580 --> 05:34.480
Agreed.
This planet is all wrong.

05:34.510 --> 05:38.650
No, literally!
We landed on the wrong planet!

05:38.680 --> 05:40.000
Gosh dang it.

05:40.030 --> 05:41.240
Crap it rough!

05:41.270 --> 05:42.510
Of course, it's left.
It's always left.

05:42.550 --> 05:44.370
Everything in my life
has always been left.

05:44.410 --> 05:46.440
Left!
Left!

05:47.340 --> 05:52.130
KVN: Wup, wup, wup! yum!
Wup, wup, wup!

05:52.170 --> 05:54.340
Quinn:
How does it feel, KVN?

05:56.100 --> 05:59.000
To be so hot,
so good looking,

05:59.030 --> 06:03.340
so [Groans]
so handsome?

06:06.370 --> 06:08.750
Hmm.
So, uh, am I

06:08.790 --> 06:11.410
the best-looking thing
aboard the Galaxy One?

06:11.440 --> 06:12.750
By far.

06:12.790 --> 06:14.060
Ohhhhh.

06:14.100 --> 06:16.410
Quinn, I can make you
very happy here.

06:16.440 --> 06:17.930
Uh,
should I kill Gary?

06:17.960 --> 06:20.240
What?!
No.

06:20.270 --> 06:22.130
But soon.

06:22.170 --> 06:23.750
Then it will just
be the two of us.

06:23.790 --> 06:25.410
And when I say hot,

06:25.440 --> 06:28.580
that doesn't even begin to
describe what you've got coming.

06:28.620 --> 06:30.860
Oooooh,
I like it hot!

06:30.890 --> 06:34.930
Then you just untie me,
KVN.

06:34.960 --> 06:37.240
Maybe I can
re-tie you later?

06:37.270 --> 06:39.000
With love knots?

06:39.030 --> 06:40.240
And then I can kill Gary later,
right?

06:40.270 --> 06:42.820
Just untie me,
you metallic moron!

06:42.860 --> 06:44.170
Sorry, just to be clear,

06:44.200 --> 06:46.750
did you say kill Gary,
or don't kill Gary?

06:46.790 --> 06:48.240
Shut up.

06:48.270 --> 06:51.100
H.U.E., ready a HAWK.
I got a breach to close.

06:52.060 --> 06:53.930
Quinn, you should reconsider.

06:53.960 --> 06:55.820
Too late.
Open the hangar.

06:55.860 --> 06:57.650
Quinn,
I think there is something

06:57.680 --> 06:59.410
you should see before you go.

06:59.440 --> 07:02.510
Not interested, H.U.E.
No one left to trust.

07:02.550 --> 07:04.340
You can trust Gary.

07:04.370 --> 07:05.480
[ Laughs ]

07:05.510 --> 07:07.100
That's a joke, right?

07:08.410 --> 07:09.860
What's this?

07:09.890 --> 07:12.000
It's time you get to know
the real Gary.

07:13.750 --> 07:14.890
[ Gasps ]

07:14.930 --> 07:16.240
There are hundreds.

07:16.270 --> 07:18.720
Yes, one for every day
of his sentence.

07:18.750 --> 07:22.000
Oooh.

07:22.030 --> 07:23.650
Hey, Quinn!
It's me, Gary.

07:23.680 --> 07:25.240
[ Chuckles]
Day one!

07:25.270 --> 07:27.340
Uh, I should probably start
by apologizing to you

07:27.370 --> 07:29.030
and of course
the Sanchez family

07:29.060 --> 07:32.130
for blowing up their very mediocre restaurant.

07:32.170 --> 07:34.550
[ Laughs]
If we're being honest.

07:34.580 --> 07:36.130
[ Laughs ]

07:36.170 --> 07:38.750
Looks like we've come down with
a case of wrong-planet-itis.

07:38.790 --> 07:40.410
Luckily,
there's a cure.

07:40.440 --> 07:41.510
What?

07:41.550 --> 07:43.410
Jump to the next planet!

07:43.440 --> 07:44.580
Aaaah!

07:44.620 --> 07:46.580
[ Sighs ]

07:46.620 --> 07:48.370
What?
No tunes, baby?!

07:48.410 --> 07:49.930
Whoo!
[ Laughs ]

07:49.960 --> 07:51.060
[ Rock music plays ]Yeah!

07:51.100 --> 07:52.820
We're planet jumping,
man!

07:52.860 --> 07:54.200
We are planet jumping!

07:54.240 --> 07:58.480
♪♪

07:58.510 --> 07:59.750
[ Music stops ]

07:59.790 --> 08:01.820
[ Rocks crumbling ]

08:01.860 --> 08:03.750
All right!
Let's kill them all!

08:03.790 --> 08:05.820
[ Laughs ]
Aaaaaaaah!

08:05.860 --> 08:07.680
They're never
gonna see us coming!

08:10.030 --> 08:12.440
[ Panting ]Oh! Whoa! [ Laughs ]

08:14.240 --> 08:16.310
I say we burst in,
guns blazing.

08:16.340 --> 08:17.930
Blind fire from the hip.

08:17.960 --> 08:19.510
For Little Cato.

08:19.550 --> 08:21.000
For Little Cato.

08:21.030 --> 08:22.370
Meow!

08:22.410 --> 08:23.930
[ Beeping ]

08:23.960 --> 08:27.100
[ Dramatic music plays ]

08:28.680 --> 08:30.370
[ Screaming ]

08:39.060 --> 08:43.000
[ Gasps ]
Oh, come on!

08:43.030 --> 08:44.650
Oh, great.
Nobody's around.

08:44.680 --> 08:46.340
This is totally a trap.

08:46.370 --> 08:47.240
Where are you going?

08:47.270 --> 08:48.510
I gotta take care
of some biz.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.510
Curious?
No.

08:49.550 --> 08:50.750
Thought so.

08:50.790 --> 08:52.130
I gotta release
a fat pee stream.

08:52.170 --> 08:54.130
I wasn't curious.You were totally curious.

08:54.170 --> 08:56.200
No, I wasn't!I -- Whatever!

08:56.240 --> 08:58.060
Little Cato: Papa.

08:58.100 --> 08:59.550
Cato.

08:59.580 --> 09:00.750
[ Wings flutter ]

09:00.790 --> 09:03.130
Papa.

09:03.170 --> 09:05.060
Papa.

09:05.100 --> 09:06.860
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

09:06.890 --> 09:08.890
[ Electricity crackling ]

09:10.930 --> 09:12.310
[ Distorted scream ]

09:12.340 --> 09:14.510
♪♪

09:14.550 --> 09:16.410
Papa.

09:16.440 --> 09:18.410
Little Cato!

09:18.440 --> 09:19.750
Ooh.

09:19.790 --> 09:22.340
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm,
not to kill the reunion vibe,

09:22.370 --> 09:26.030
but there's something mega
not right with your boy.

09:26.060 --> 09:28.680
[ Distorted scream ]

09:28.720 --> 09:31.000
It's my fault.
He's angry with me.

09:31.030 --> 09:32.060
Well, it's, uh, you know,
that's great.

09:32.100 --> 09:33.480
[ Laughs ]
It's good, it's good.

09:33.510 --> 09:36.370
But, uh, he's got a weird way
of showing that,

09:36.410 --> 09:40.030
in the fact that
he's hovering off the ground!

09:40.060 --> 09:41.650
Yeah, you got a point.

09:41.680 --> 09:43.860
I got a point?
I know I do.

09:43.890 --> 09:45.650
Aah!
Aah! Agh!

09:45.680 --> 09:46.930
Okay,
nice to meet you.

09:46.960 --> 09:48.130
And your name is?

09:48.170 --> 09:50.680
Death is sweeter than life.

09:50.720 --> 09:52.650
I don't know
why more kids aren't named

09:52.680 --> 09:54.060
"Death is sweeter
than life."

09:54.100 --> 09:56.240
Fine boy
you have here.

10:00.200 --> 10:02.060
Things are about
to get real.

10:02.100 --> 10:03.720
You kept your promise,
Gary.

10:03.750 --> 10:05.480
Go back.
Go back to Quinn.

10:05.510 --> 10:06.890
Why would
you even say that?

10:06.930 --> 10:08.890
Because -- what do
you really know about me?

10:08.930 --> 10:11.060
I know for a guy who says
he's not a cat,

10:11.100 --> 10:12.170
you sure do love milk.

10:12.200 --> 10:13.550
Other than that,
not a lot.

10:13.580 --> 10:17.510
Gary, I hate the Lord Commander
for a reason.

10:17.550 --> 10:20.240
I used to be
his Second in Command.

10:20.270 --> 10:22.410
♪♪

10:22.440 --> 10:24.060
I was a master of death.

10:24.100 --> 10:27.510
I did anything
the Lord Commander asked of me.

10:28.440 --> 10:31.720
He above all else
demanded loyalty.

10:31.750 --> 10:33.680
And one day, he ordered
all of his generals

10:33.720 --> 10:35.310
to prove
their allegiance to him

10:35.340 --> 10:37.060
by killing
their firstborn.

10:37.100 --> 10:38.750
Oh,
that's pretty dark.

10:38.790 --> 10:40.410
Like midnight dark.

10:40.440 --> 10:42.130
Like the darkest
of the dark.

10:42.170 --> 10:44.650
Like super dark.

10:44.680 --> 10:46.030
Together:
For eternity!

10:46.060 --> 10:47.620
For the Lord Commander!

10:51.030 --> 10:52.170
[ Lasers fire ]

10:52.200 --> 10:53.750
Lord Commander:
Do it, Avocato,

10:53.790 --> 10:56.130
and become my First.

10:56.170 --> 10:57.200
Do it!

10:57.240 --> 11:01.000
♪♪

11:01.030 --> 11:02.240
Soldier: Aah!

11:02.270 --> 11:03.820
Gary: Why didn't you just
kill the Big Cheese?

11:03.860 --> 11:05.240
Avocato: I tried.

11:05.270 --> 11:06.860
Did you?
Yes.

11:06.890 --> 11:09.030
Okay, I like that out of you.
Yeah, I believe you.

11:09.060 --> 11:12.650
♪♪

11:12.680 --> 11:18.860
If I sense doubt in you
ever again, remember --

11:18.890 --> 11:22.060
I own your son!

11:22.100 --> 11:26.030
And now...I own you!

11:26.060 --> 11:27.680
♪♪

11:27.720 --> 11:29.720
How'd ya end up
with a little green tic-tac

11:29.750 --> 11:32.030
cosmic butt head like that
in the first place?

11:32.060 --> 11:33.550
By not asking
the questions

11:33.580 --> 11:35.240
I didn't want
to hear the answers to.Mm-hmm.

11:35.270 --> 11:36.750
What the hell
does that even mean?

11:36.790 --> 11:38.410
I've made
a lot of mistakes.

11:38.440 --> 11:41.030
You still want
anything to do with me?

11:41.060 --> 11:42.580
All of us are broken.

11:42.620 --> 11:44.240
Just a question
of how much

11:44.270 --> 11:46.580
and how far we're willing
to go to fix it.

11:46.620 --> 11:48.240
Seems like you want that
pretty bad.

11:48.270 --> 11:50.170
Yeah.Then as far as I'm concerned,

11:50.200 --> 11:51.580
we're back
to where we started.

11:51.620 --> 11:53.550
I made you a promise
to get your son back.

11:53.580 --> 11:55.680
And until we get him back,
I got your back.

11:55.720 --> 11:58.240
It's back to back
for life!

11:58.270 --> 12:03.750
Heeeeeeeeeeeey, Quinn!

12:03.790 --> 12:04.890
Gary again.

12:04.930 --> 12:05.930
I wrote a jingle --

12:05.960 --> 12:07.310
well, more of a ballad --

12:07.340 --> 12:09.680
which I called "Love Pain."

12:09.720 --> 12:12.370
Actually, wait. No.
It's called "Pain Love."

12:12.410 --> 12:13.410
It's one of those two.

12:13.440 --> 12:14.750
Ooh.
A song? Ooh.

12:14.790 --> 12:16.510
H.U.E. won't let me have
a guitar.

12:16.550 --> 12:18.000
[ Laughs]
Do you really think

12:18.030 --> 12:20.240
I'm going to hang myself
by guitar strings?!

12:20.270 --> 12:21.580
H.U.E.: Yes, dude.

12:21.620 --> 12:23.000
Yeah, well,
you're probably right.

12:23.030 --> 12:25.240
So I made one
out of a plastic spoon,

12:25.270 --> 12:26.480
three pieces
of gravity tape,

12:26.510 --> 12:28.750
a Cheeto, and my hair.

12:28.790 --> 12:30.410
[ Laughs ][ Spoon guitar strumming]

12:30.440 --> 12:32.000
All right,
let me just tune it.

12:32.030 --> 12:33.860
You know,
I haven't practiced this,

12:33.890 --> 12:36.240
so I'm a little bit rusty.That idiot.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.410
[ Clears throat]

12:37.440 --> 12:39.240
♪ It hurts, it burns♪

12:39.270 --> 12:40.720
♪ It pains, it laughs♪

12:40.750 --> 12:43.270
Ready, Papa?

12:46.750 --> 12:47.890
Ready, son.

12:51.030 --> 12:54.720
♪♪

12:54.750 --> 12:56.240
Gary: I mean, you know
the Lord Commander's

12:56.270 --> 12:58.580
gonna be behind this door,
right?

12:58.620 --> 13:01.410
Surprise!

13:01.440 --> 13:03.030
[ Laughs ]
Surprise?

13:03.060 --> 13:05.890
You gotta be kidding.Dude, no one's surprised.

13:05.930 --> 13:08.750
I spent many hours of my day
planning this.

13:08.790 --> 13:13.370
Everyone in the entire prison
was murdered for this surprise!

13:13.410 --> 13:14.580
Well,
I don't know what to tell ya.

13:14.620 --> 13:16.410
I don't think
it was worth it.Silence!

13:16.440 --> 13:17.410
Okay.

13:17.440 --> 13:19.410
Oh.
Ohhhh.

13:19.440 --> 13:23.000
I have more surprises for you,
the Gary.

13:23.030 --> 13:24.550
Just...Gary.

13:24.580 --> 13:28.240
As for your father...
kill him.

13:28.270 --> 13:29.750
[ Roars ]

13:29.790 --> 13:30.750
[ Grunts ]

13:30.790 --> 13:32.820
Ahhhhh!

13:32.860 --> 13:34.200
[ Grunting ]

13:34.240 --> 13:37.510
Get on with it,
you fun-sized devil.

13:37.550 --> 13:40.750
We both know you won't tell me
where Mooncake is,

13:40.790 --> 13:44.860
so I think it's time
I find him myself.

13:47.240 --> 13:49.200
[ Grunting ]

13:53.550 --> 13:54.930
Gary:
What are you doin'?

13:54.960 --> 13:57.340
Get outta my mind, yo.

13:57.370 --> 14:01.550
This consciousness quadrant
is members only.

14:01.580 --> 14:04.410
So get out of my mind.

14:04.440 --> 14:07.750
You can't do that.
It's my mind.

14:07.790 --> 14:10.750
I didn't invite you
into my mind.

14:10.790 --> 14:13.170
Get outta my mind!

14:13.200 --> 14:14.890
What's this
blinking one?

14:14.930 --> 14:17.060
H.U.E.:
That means incoming message.

14:17.100 --> 14:19.240
It must have been delayed
by the interference.

14:19.270 --> 14:20.860
Sure, whatever.
Play it.

14:20.890 --> 14:23.930
This may be the last time
we talk one-on-one.

14:23.960 --> 14:26.860
Uh, I told Avocato
I was taking a fat pee,

14:26.890 --> 14:29.890
but I just wanted to connect
with you one last time

14:29.930 --> 14:32.170
in case, you know,
I don't survive this.

14:32.200 --> 14:33.410
Quinn, I know I don't say

14:33.440 --> 14:34.410
the right thing
half the time

14:34.440 --> 14:35.860
or any of the time.

14:35.890 --> 14:37.820
You know, in fact,
I have Word-arrhea.

14:37.860 --> 14:40.370
It's an unpleasant spraying
of words that just won't quit.

14:40.410 --> 14:41.580
It -- I mean,
it's -- it's a thing.

14:41.620 --> 14:43.410
Uh, I want you to know

14:43.440 --> 14:45.650
that I know
that I hurt you back there.

14:45.680 --> 14:47.310
Shut up.Shut up!
Shut up!

14:47.340 --> 14:51.060
Could you please
shut up?!
Shut up!

14:51.100 --> 14:53.060
I don't expect that rope
to hold you very long.

14:53.100 --> 14:55.820
I mean, you're pretty awesome
and agile and hot.

14:55.860 --> 14:59.370
I guess you probably left
theGalaxy One by now.

14:59.410 --> 15:00.930
But I want you to know that...

15:00.960 --> 15:03.860
I would have went with you
till the very end.

15:03.890 --> 15:05.200
I'm sorry, Quinn.

15:05.240 --> 15:07.720
I hope one day I can repair
the trust I broke.

15:07.750 --> 15:09.750
♪♪

15:09.790 --> 15:14.340
H.U.E.: Gary always puts other
people's lives before his own.

15:14.370 --> 15:16.720
H.U.E., where's Gary? Unclear.

15:16.750 --> 15:18.680
I have lost
communications with him.

15:18.720 --> 15:20.820
Then we better get down there
and find him.

15:20.860 --> 15:22.310
We're coming, Gary.

15:22.340 --> 15:24.170
Hell, yeah, dawg.

15:24.200 --> 15:27.750
♪♪

15:29.370 --> 15:31.650
Aah![ Roars ]

15:31.680 --> 15:32.930
Little Cato?!

15:32.960 --> 15:35.890
Little Cato no longer
controls this body.

15:36.790 --> 15:38.130
I know
you're in there, son.

15:38.170 --> 15:39.200
Wrong.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.370
Agh!

15:40.410 --> 15:42.620
[ Growling ]

15:45.620 --> 15:48.820
[ Grunting ]

15:48.860 --> 15:51.720
I've been a terrible father.
[ Coughs ]

15:51.750 --> 15:54.480
The Lord Commander ruined me,
and I lost you.

15:54.510 --> 15:57.580
Please, son.
Don't let him ruin you.

15:57.620 --> 15:59.170
What if it's too late?

16:00.510 --> 16:01.960
[ Coughs ]

16:03.720 --> 16:05.060
It's not.

16:05.100 --> 16:06.240
You're still right here.

16:06.270 --> 16:08.130
[ Sighs ]

16:08.170 --> 16:10.130
[ Groans ]

16:10.170 --> 16:12.580
[ Gasps ]
Dad?

16:12.620 --> 16:16.200
♪♪

16:16.240 --> 16:17.340
Ohh!

16:17.370 --> 16:19.650
What the heck
took you so long?!

16:19.680 --> 16:21.650
[ Laughs ]

16:21.680 --> 16:24.030
Now, let's get
the hell out of here.

16:24.060 --> 16:28.720
♪♪

16:28.750 --> 16:31.060
[ Electricity crackling ]

16:31.100 --> 16:33.720
♪♪

16:37.750 --> 16:40.000
There you are.

16:40.030 --> 16:41.580
Aah!

16:41.620 --> 16:44.820
Mooncake is aboard
the Galaxy One.

16:44.860 --> 16:47.860
No.
He's right here.

16:49.100 --> 16:50.200
Now, Mooncake!

16:50.240 --> 16:52.030
[ Grunts ]
Chookity!

16:52.060 --> 16:54.790
No!

16:58.620 --> 17:01.000
[ Alarms blaring ]

17:01.030 --> 17:03.930
♪♪

17:03.960 --> 17:05.410
Time to go, bud!

17:05.440 --> 17:06.680
Name's Gary
by the way.

17:06.720 --> 17:08.680
Nice to see your paws
touching the ground.

17:08.720 --> 17:10.100
Little Cato.
Likewise.

17:11.510 --> 17:13.930
We need to get
to the Galaxy One.

17:13.960 --> 17:17.100
♪♪

17:19.270 --> 17:20.580
I got this.

17:20.620 --> 17:21.890
[ Device beeps ]Boom! Done.

17:21.930 --> 17:23.750
You're almost as good
as me.

17:23.790 --> 17:25.860
Please,
I passed you years ago.

17:27.370 --> 17:29.170
[ Groans ]

17:29.200 --> 17:30.550
Huh?

17:32.620 --> 17:34.060
-Oh, come on!
-[ Gasps ]

17:34.100 --> 17:35.370
Aah!

17:35.410 --> 17:37.060
♪♪

17:37.100 --> 17:40.510
KVN is here
to save the day!

17:44.370 --> 17:46.000
-That was tight.
-Let's move it.

17:46.030 --> 17:49.030
♪♪

18:00.170 --> 18:02.030
-Gary!
-Quinn! Where are you?!

18:02.060 --> 18:03.170
Now, H.U.E.!

18:04.680 --> 18:06.750
[ All screaming ]

18:06.790 --> 18:08.750
KVN,
I'm lowering the tether.

18:08.790 --> 18:12.370
Oh, Quinn,
you really do love me.

18:12.410 --> 18:13.510
I don't love you.

18:13.550 --> 18:16.370
I [Static crackles] love you.

18:16.410 --> 18:18.170
Yes!

18:18.200 --> 18:19.410
♪♪

18:19.440 --> 18:22.130
[ Groaning ]

18:22.170 --> 18:25.930
♪♪

18:29.890 --> 18:31.580
[ Sticky bomb beeps ]

18:31.620 --> 18:33.310
♪♪

18:33.340 --> 18:35.860
[ Beeping ]

18:37.550 --> 18:40.790
♪♪

18:42.060 --> 18:45.860
♪ Ooh

18:50.030 --> 18:54.060
♪ Ooh

18:54.100 --> 18:58.030
♪ Ooh, ooh

19:01.960 --> 19:06.060
♪♪

19:06.100 --> 19:09.580
Hoo! Wah-wah-wah wah,
wah-wah-wah-wah-wah-wah.

19:09.620 --> 19:12.060
Yay!
Gary, Gary, Gary.

19:12.100 --> 19:13.580
Hey, hey, hey.

19:13.620 --> 19:20.100
♪ Ooh, ooh, ooh

19:22.060 --> 19:25.030
♪ Ooh

19:25.060 --> 19:27.000
As excited
as I am about today,

19:27.030 --> 19:29.240
I'm even more excited
for tomorrow.

19:29.270 --> 19:30.930
Yeah.

19:30.960 --> 19:33.680
♪♪

19:33.720 --> 19:35.860
[ Beeping ][ Gasps ]

19:38.170 --> 19:39.340
No!

19:39.370 --> 19:41.030
-No.
-Take care of my boy.

19:41.060 --> 19:43.480
No! D-Dad!

19:43.510 --> 19:45.340
[ Bomb beeping rapidly ]

19:45.370 --> 19:47.820
♪ Welcome

19:47.860 --> 19:51.750
♪ Inch'Allah, Inch'Allah

19:51.790 --> 19:58.750
♪ Enter one amazing grace

19:58.790 --> 20:02.240
♪ Is pouring down

20:02.270 --> 20:05.580
♪ Fear not this light

20:05.620 --> 20:12.510
♪ We are of this light divine

20:12.550 --> 20:16.170
♪ So come

20:16.200 --> 20:19.750
♪ We move as one

20:19.790 --> 20:23.240
♪ Amazing grace

20:23.270 --> 20:26.580
♪ is pouring down

20:26.620 --> 20:30.060
♪ Fear not this light

20:30.100 --> 20:37.750
♪ We are on this light divine

20:37.790 --> 20:43.170
♪ Welcome, enter one

20:43.200 --> 20:46.200
[ Electricity crackles ]

20:46.240 --> 20:49.270
♪♪

20:54.240 --> 20:54.580
♪♪
